# Overlay series fragment sidebar: applied after atlas/patches/series and the fragments before it
# (file-name order). Owner: ATLAS-SIDEBAR. One entry per line, a path under atlas/patches.
# atlas-series refuses a patch listed twice and a patch number used twice, and warns when a number
# is outside this range:
# range: 0020-0023
ui/0020-default-vertical.patch
ui/0021-sidebar-metrics.patch
ui/0022-sidebar-sections.patch
ui/0023-sidebar-footer.patch
